cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or discuss this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Nomadology Visualizer"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Culp
    given-names: Andrew
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/minor-science/nomad-viz"
abstract: >-
  Interactive physical models of the machinic processes in Gilles Deleuze and
  Félix Guattari's A Thousand Plateaus (capture, the war machine, warding off,
  and others). Each model separates what Deleuze and Guattari write, the
  sources they borrow from, and what the physics actually says.
keywords:
  - Deleuze
  - Guattari
  - nomadology
  - A Thousand Plateaus
  - smooth and striated space
  - visualization
